### [TC01] Get all available boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes

### [TC02] Get box by exact name (Matcha Lover Box)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/boxname/Matcha Lover Box

### [TC03] Get all items from all boxes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items

### [TC04] Create a new box with full item list (valid)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Japanese Snack Box",
  "boxPrice": 59,
  "items": [
    { "itemName": "Tokyo Banana", "itemPrice": 85, "itemAmount": 4 },
    { "itemName": "Matcha Pocky", "itemPrice": 45, "itemAmount": 6 },
    { "itemName": "Yuzu Citrus Candy", "itemPrice": 50, "itemAmount": 5 },
    { "itemName": "Shiroi Koibito Cookies", "itemPrice": 90, "itemAmount": 3 },
    { "itemName": "Ume Plum Rice Crackers", "itemPrice": 65, "itemAmount": 4 }
  ]
}

### [TC05] Create a box with empty item list
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Empty Box",
  "boxPrice": 10,
  "items": []
}

### [TC06] Create a box with missing fields (invalid payload)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boxName": "Invalid Box"
}

### [TC07] Purchase 1 Matcha Lover Box (default)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box

### [TC08] Purchase 3 Matcha Lover Boxes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=3

### [TC09] Try to purchase more boxes than items available (quantity=99)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=99

### [TC10] Purchase a non-existent box
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Nonexistent Box

### [TC11] Purchase a box with invalid quantity (negative number)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=-5

### [TC12] Purchase multiple box themes (valid names)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 2 },
  { "boxName": "Chocolate Lover Box", "quantity": 1 }
]

